===Objectives===
* Travel to the Sunspear encampment near [[Chahbek Village (outpost)|Chahbek Village]].
* Speak to at least one expert <Profession>.
* See [[First Spear Dehvad]] for your reward.

===Reward===
* 250 [[Experience]]
* 5 [[Sunspear Promotion Point]]s
* [[Battle Commendation]]

